TI  - Metabolic responses of the deep-water sponge Geodia barretti to suspended bottom sediment, simulated mine tailings and drill cuttings
AU  - Tina Kutti
AU  - Raymond J. Bannister
AU  - Jan Helge Fosså
AU  - Cathinka M. Krogness
AU  - Ingrid Tjensvoll
AU  - Guldborg Søvik
