TY  - CPAPER
ID  - CWC-17BB509A22EF
TI  - SERPENT of the Deep—Research, Monitoring and Partnerships for a Deepwater Well off Atlantic Canada
AU  - Andre d'Entremont
AU  - J. I. Kaariainen
AU  - Krista D. Baker
PY  - 2008
